Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.10,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Han free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:06.02,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(637.273,368.182)\fade(255,0,255,0,1000,4300,5100)}Episode 15
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:06.02,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(642.727,542.727)\fade(255,0,255,0,1000,4300,5100)}Yuán and Cáo Raise Troops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:45.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(351.863,452.727)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,3820,4140)}Cáo Cāo \NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has left Xǔdū...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,... it is just as Fengxiao said!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,By releasing the enemy one day, I have brought everlasting trouble upon myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.78,0:00:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:02.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.973,444.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,740,2000,2860)}Xún Yù\NStyled: Wénruò
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Che Zhou is a trusted subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He was originally intended to govern over Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You can send a letter to Che Zhou and order him to think of a way to kill Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.58,0:01:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Chen Deng has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(697.355,335.455)\fade(255,0,255,0,660,2000,2700)}Chē Zhòu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Che, what have you summoned me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:02:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor has sent me a secret letter, telling me to get rid of Liu Bei immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.42,0:02:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, he can avoid future trouble. \NI have called you to discuss this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.74,0:02:12.46,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(346.441,444.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2350,2700)}Chén Dēng \N Styled: Yuánlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has received an order to suppress \NYuan Shu, thus gaining merits from the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.06,0:02:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does the Chancellor want to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.54,0:02:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, he has won the hearts of the citizens of Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I know the people burnt incense and blocked the streets
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.34,0:02:31.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,just to ask the Chancellor to have Liu Bei manage Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.94,0:02:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.10,0:02:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,However, when the Chancellor gives an order, how can we refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei will eventually return after pacifying the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:02:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can set up an ambush \Noutside the city and engage him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will hold off his rearguard using crossbows from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.14,0:03:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall follow your plan, Yuanlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.22,0:03:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:25.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we can work together with one heart and mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,we can report the success to the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General Chen, what irks for you to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.06,0:03:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Che Zhou was ordered by the Chancellor to kill Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:45.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(978.623,430.909)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Che Zhou has placed 1,000 troops outside the city
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,to attack the imperial uncle when he returns!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:50.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(966.391,429.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,340,1500,1780)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard Che Zhou! I will kill his entire force!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Che Zhou is already prepared. \NIf we act rashly, we will be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to think of a plan to capture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Plans, plans, plans! Let's see if that bastard\N Che Zhou can stop my serpent spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, you must restrain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.10,0:04:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang Liao, sent by Chancellor Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait until I report to General Che.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.70,0:04:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Report it quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.26,0:04:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,General Che.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanlong, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you open the gates for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're the Chancellor's troops, he will be suspicious if I don't let them in,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but if they're not, and I go to welcome them,\N I fear it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanlong, I can't be at ease since \NI placed my men into an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this issue does not bode well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the army of General Zhang?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.34,0:05:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to identify people at night. \NStation your troops outside for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,After dawn, you may enter the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.14,0:05:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But Liu Bei is onto us! \NWe can't wait, open the gates now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.06,0:05:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanlong, look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.02,0:05:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuanlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.54,0:05:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Have the ambush troops follow me\N outside the city to investigate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is General Zhang?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wretch, You dare plot to kill my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate! Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have shown the Chancellor's letter to General Guan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you've changed your mind, please get off your horse and surrender, General!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Chen Deng, you traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have led me into your trap, but I will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan, your blade is too hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother and Yuanlong,\N thank you for welcoming me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.22,0:07:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Third Brother and Inspector Che?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:27.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(280,424.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2500,3140)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to tell you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That traitor, Che Zhou, tried to kill you, so I took his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.82,0:07:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Would he really try to do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't Che Zhou's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.14,0:07:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who wanted to kill the Imperial Uncle was Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Yide?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to kill Che Zhou's family in vengeance, he's in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he trying to ruin me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have exterminated Che Zhou's entire...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.02,0:08:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, the one who deserved it is dead,\N but those who didn't are dead too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the use of lamenting anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who should we kill? Who shouldn't we kill?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Che Zhou was a trusted officer of Cao Cao. Did you not know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.50,0:09:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5}When we left Xuchang,\N you said it yourself, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,From now on, we would no longer be tied back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If we must kill, then kill we shall! Isn't it too late to regret it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"Too late"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If Cao Cao has an excuse to raise \Ntroops against us, what are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.38,0:09:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When Cao Cao comes, Yide and I will meet him and that will be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Second and Third Brothers, you are mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your unworthy brother knows that you don't fear Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but we have just come back to \NXú Province without a secure foothold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.86,0:10:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, our men are few and provisions scarce. What do we have to boast about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If the people of Xu Province get caught up in war once more...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,because of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, you needn't worry. I have a plan that can fend off Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.82,0:10:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, the only one Cao Cao fears is Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shao watches over Ji, Qing, You, and Bing provinces.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,His army numbers a million; he has a myriad of talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not send a message to Yuan Shao asking for reinforcements?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.38,0:11:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never made contact with Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.78,0:11:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have just defeated his younger brother, Yuan Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.34,0:11:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why would he want to help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a man who has had good relations with the Yuan family for three generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If he writes a letter, Yuan Shao will certainly send help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.22,0:11:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, why not try?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.30,0:11:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.46,0:11:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei just destroyed my brother, \Nso I did not want to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.46,0:11:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,However, he had {\i1}Secretary Zheng Xuan{\i0} send a letter, asking for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:36.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(963.645,441.818)\fade(255,0,255,0,520,2120,2620)}Yuán Shào\NStyled: Běnchū
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Zheng...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Zheng...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.98,0:11:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Xuande is a hero of our age.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:12:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I listen to Master Zheng and aid Liu to oppose Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,what would you all think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.98,0:12:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}After years of raising troops, \Nthe people have suffered greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.38,0:12:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The granaries are empty and taxes are heavier by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.86,0:12:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We cannot draft more into your grand army!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We could claim victories to the Son of Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If we can't reach the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}then we can memorialize that\N Cao Cao has been abusing power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12} After that, we only need to \Nstation troops at Liyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.14,0:12:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Concurrently, we can use our righteous army to launch an expedition against the rebel,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.14,0:12:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and settle the land within 3 years!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tian Feng is right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.22,0:12:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}His words are improper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With your divine might \Nand the strength of the north,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.82,0:12:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}destroying Cao Cao is as easy \Nas turning one's palm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.78,0:12:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}What need is there\N for a three-year plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.06,0:13:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If we hold off, \Nit may ruin your grand plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.94,0:13:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Your words make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Wanting to pacify such a scourge\N will make the army feel righteous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yet confident from their numbers, the army is arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}A righteous army is strong,\N but an arrogant army will perish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.86,0:13:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Cao Cao's laws are pragmatic and his men are well trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If we don't use the plan of "petition" {\bord12}and instead raise nameless troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.30,0:13:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}then our army will be\N at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I beseech you to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Our men are better than those of Cao Cao. \NHow could they be without a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Our warriors are brave; our men are in high spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If we don't settle this matter swiftly, we will be inviting disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.02,0:13:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I ask that you listen to Secretary Zheng, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.54,0:13:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Join Liu Bei in his righteousness and destroy that rebel, Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}This is the will of both Heaven \Nand the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.86,0:14:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All of your words seem reasonable,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.74,0:14:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but it is hard to discern who is right and who is wrong. What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Zheng...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, if your migraine is unbearable, why don't you rest for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.62,0:15:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If Liu Bei makes contact with Yuan Shao and ally together, what can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We can't underestimate Yuan Shao's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:39.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We can't send men at the moment. We can only ask for peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan Shao is incompetent. What need is there for peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, you are mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.46,0:15:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yuan Shao's territories are vast, and his people strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}His subordinates, such as {\i1}Xǔ Yōu, {\bord12}Guō Tú, Shěn Pèi, Páng Ji,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.54,0:16:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}are wise strategists all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}There is also {\i1}Tián Fēng{\i0} and {\i1}Jǔ Shòu.{\i0} \NBoth are loyal ministers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\i1}Yan Liang{\i0} and {\i1}Wen Chou{\i0} are officers of peerless bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Others, like {\i1}Gāo Lǎn, Zhāng Hé, \N{\i0}and{\i1} Chúnyú Qióng,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.62,0:16:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}all of them renowned generals of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, why call Yuan Shao incompetent?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Even though Yuan Shao's troops and warriors are numerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}his laws aren't scrupulous \Nand his discipline lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Tian Feng is willful but obstinate; \NXu You is gluttonous but not bright;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Shen Pei is devoted but not resourceful; and Pang Ji is resolute but inept.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}All these people are incompatible with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:17:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sooner or later, there will be internal conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Furthermore, Yuan Shao relies on the numbers and is indecisive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Even with thousands of his men, how can he succeed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(468.182,357.273)}Jǔ Shòu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Report, my lord! Master Xu You is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xu has a lot of insight. \NLet's listen to what he has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.94,0:18:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xu, you came at the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Zheng has asked me to send reinforcements to Liu Bei against Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.62,0:18:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I mobilize the army or not? Please enlighten me, Lord Xu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.90,0:18:42.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(306.815,429.545)\fade(255,0,255,0,620,2000,2700)}Xǔ Yōu\NStyled: Zǐyuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My lord, if you use the many to invade the few \Nand use the strong to attack the weak,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}you can punish the rebels and restore the ruling house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.42,0:19:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You must mobilize an army!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.62,0:19:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lord Xu, that is exactly what I thought of!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I want Shen Pei and Pang Ji \Nto oversee conscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.66,0:19:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Tian Feng and Xu You \Nwill be my advisors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yan Liang and Wen Chou \Nwill be my commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.78,0:19:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Gather 150,000 cavalry \Nand 150,000 infantry,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}a total of 300,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Have them march to Liyang at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.74,0:19:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.22,0:19:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.14,0:19:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, if we are to justly punish \NCao Cao, we must first list his vices.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:44.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Send a declaration of war to every commandery, denouncing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is the proper way of doing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongzhang?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.62,0:19:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Enumerate the many crimes of Cao Cao and send it to every commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.50,0:20:06.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(306.799,456.818)\fade(255,0,255,0,620,1660,2260)}Chén Lín\NStyled: Kǒngzhāng
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.46,0:20:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Of old, the strength of Qin was debased by a weak ruler, thus Zhao Gao domineered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.86,0:20:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The Empire acted to his bidding, \Nits wealth and power at his whims' behest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.54,0:20:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}for those against him were subdued, and none dared to speak with candor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}To this end there came to be the Disaster of Wangyi, the massacre of many families.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:26.78,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Referring to late Qin dynasty, when Zhao Gao forced Qin Er Shi to commit suicide in order to gain more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Reviled to this day,\N forever is his name served as a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.06,0:20:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop without my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The Ducal Minister of Works, Cáo Cāo,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}whose grandfather was the Regular Attendant Cao Teng, who, with Zuo Guan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:21:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and Xú Huáng, tormentors of the common men, \Nviolate the state with depravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.22,0:21:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}His father, Cao Song, \Nthis eunuch-adopted groveler,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.74,0:21:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}with his venal false-name, \Nnow a briber of the powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.46,0:21:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}stealer of titles, and corrupter of imperium.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Cao Cao, his obscenity inherent,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}loves only to ravage, revels only in ruin...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My... my head feels better now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Who wrote this Essay of Denunciation?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.26,0:22:20.18,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Essays of Denunciation (檄文) were manifestos written as condemnations of character and declaration of war, written as far back as the Xia-Shang dynasties and as late as 1920s.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.46,0:22:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have heard it comes from Chen Lin's own hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.66,0:22:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who write these letters need to back it up with real spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.98,0:22:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though Chen Lin's style is excellent, it's a shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.14,0:22:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,that Yuan Shao's strategy is lacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.82,0:22:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,His strategy is lacking!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.26,0:22:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Yuan Shao and his 350,000 army are marching from Liyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.02,0:22:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Call everybody here to discuss. We must prepare!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.94,0:22:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Dai and Wang Zhong!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.98,0:23:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.66,0:23:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You two will lead 50,000 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.34,0:23:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The vanguard will be Liu Dai \Nand the rear will be Wang Zhong!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.46,0:23:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When you march out, you will go to Xú Province and attack Liu Bei!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.90,0:23:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.86,0:23:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After Generals Liu and Wang have set out,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.58,0:23:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,the rest are to follow me towards Liyang to counter Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring us the commander's banner.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.62,0:23:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to general's Liu and Wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.38,0:23:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.42,0:23:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your own banner.\N How could we dare to fly it in your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.38,0:24:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,An order for you to fly my own banner when attacking Xú Province
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.14,0:24:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,is just to make an empty show of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.78,0:24:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've set up camp, don't advance recklessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.66,0:24:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I have defeated Yuan Shao, I will march to defeat Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.94,0:24:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.06,0:24:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.54,0:24:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.90,0:25:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if the Chancellor has already arrived at Liyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.18,0:25:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more concerned about when he can go to Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.66,0:25:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor's army should come as fast as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.66,0:25:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, I can return this banner, lest it be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.62,0:25:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry about someone as irrelevant as Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.30,0:25:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When we arrive in Xu Province, just send someone to Hebei to inform the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.18,0:25:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.02,0:25:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spies at Hebei have returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.38,0:25:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the military situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.26,0:25:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan and Cao have not \Nengaged in combat yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.06,0:25:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They haven't engaged yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.34,0:25:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.54,0:25:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some water and explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.42,0:25:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuan and Cao have brought their men. Even though their armies are fierce,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.26,0:25:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Liyang has a strong defense. They're locked in a stalemate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.06,0:26:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't they fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.86,0:26:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}It's said Xu You is unhappy with Shen Pei's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.58,0:26:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Ju Shou resents that Yuan Shao hasn't used his advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.70,0:26:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}All have selfish motives \Nand won't press the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.42,0:26:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yuan Shao was unable to make up his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.70,0:26:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now that he is even more uncertain, he will not make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.38,0:26:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}And why won't Cao Cao make a move?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.90,0:26:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I couldn't get enough information.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.78,0:26:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I only heard that Cao Cao ordered Lü Bu's former officer, Zang Ba, to guard Qing and Xu Provinces.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.34,0:26:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Yu Jin and Li Dian are along the Yellow River. \NCao Cao himself has stationed his men at Guandu.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.74,0:26:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Cao Cao now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.34,0:26:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be at Liyang. \NHe could be at Xǔdū. He could be at...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.42,0:26:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.86,0:26:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,At Xú Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.54,0:26:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.50,0:26:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's in Xú Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.34,0:27:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then if this is true, then doesn't that mean \NCao Cao is the one camped outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.86,0:27:24.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(282.727,465)\fade(255,0,255,0,380,2820,3140)}Wáng Zhōng
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.26,0:27:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor didn't engage Yuan Shao. He's come back to Xǔdū secretly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.54,0:27:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When he left, he ordered us to meet Liu Bei in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.74,0:27:58.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,380,3860,4260)\pos(403.982,447.304)}Liú Dài \NStyled: Gōngshān
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.54,0:27:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't you attack, General?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.98,0:28:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is a clever man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.02,0:28:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If he discovers the Chancellor is not in the camp
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.22,0:28:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,he will join up with Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.66,0:28:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How can you sit idly and not seize this opportunity?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.42,0:28:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How would you explain it before the Chancellor?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.86,0:28:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the Chancellor has ordered us to attack, you go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.02,0:28:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He has ordered you to go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.86,0:28:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the commanding general.\NHow could I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.54,0:28:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's stop arguing over who is the commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.34,0:28:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Per the orders of the Chancellor, we'll attack together.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.78,0:28:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.90,0:28:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it proper to fight over who goes first?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.58,0:28:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's draw lots. Whoever draws the written note goes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.50,0:28:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, let's draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.06,0:29:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to write them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't back down now, General. \NMarch at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.50,0:29:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.22,0:29:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Cao army have left camp to march here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.02,0:29:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose banner do they have?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.42,0:29:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The center holds Cao's.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.06,0:29:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't wait for their armies to attack us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.62,0:30:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, send me with Second Brother to meet the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.50,0:30:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I heard Cao Cao's banner is nowhere to be seen in Liyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.26,0:30:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Why is his banner here, instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.58,0:30:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Cao Cao is wily man\N and likes to supervise battles himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.10,0:30:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Thus, he decided not to fly his banner at Liyang,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.66,0:30:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}which means the banner is being falsely raised here. \NI think Cao Cao is actually not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.38,0:30:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We can send somebody to find out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.34,0:30:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.78,0:30:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too reckless and violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.98,0:30:33.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If the commander in the center really is Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.30,0:30:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will capture him and bring him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.22,0:30:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, I can scout it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.26,0:30:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go, Yunchang, I can be at peace. You may bring 3,000 men with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.66,0:30:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother, defend the city. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.58,0:30:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You only need to find out whether that's really Cao Cao!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.54,0:31:10.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(733.333,289.333)}"First"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.74,0:31:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.18,0:31:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, you may ask this man about the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.10,0:31:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And who may you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.42,0:31:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Wang Zhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.34,0:31:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What rank do you hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.66,0:31:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an assistant officer under Chancellor Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.38,0:31:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Preposterous! How dare you march \Nunder the Chancellor's banner?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.26,0:31:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare! I was only following orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.82,0:31:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He ordered me to use his reputation to confuse your troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.30,0:31:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Cao Cao now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.22,0:31:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.78,0:31:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.22,0:32:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already returned to Xǔdū!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.42,0:32:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.38,0:32:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.02,0:32:16.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Prepare clothes and food for General Wang and put him in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.02,0:32:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We'll discuss what to do once we have Liu Dai.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.14,0:32:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.14,0:32:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.58,0:32:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.34,0:32:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have killed Che Zhou, so I brought Wang Zhong alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.98,0:32:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This way you may use him in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.22,0:33:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You were only keeping me safe. What are you saying? If anything, I should be ashamed!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.18,0:33:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.86,0:33:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.02,0:33:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother! Now that Wang Zhong is captured, let me go for Liu Dai!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.70,0:33:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Dai was the Overseer of Shandong. When we fought Dong Zhuo at Hulao Gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.06,0:33:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,he too was one of the lords there. \NWe can't underestimate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.10,0:33:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What can someone like him do?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.06,0:33:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, like Second Brother, I will just bring him here alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I just fear that you will take his life and ruin my cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.74,0:33:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If I kill him, you may take my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.66,0:33:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.22,0:33:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I will give you another 3,000 men. Bring Liu Dai to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.66,0:34:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Dai, you coward! Come out if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.58,0:34:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Insult them! As much as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.58,0:34:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Insult him! Louder!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.18,0:34:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, insult them!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.38,0:34:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Insult them until dusk. See if they can stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.50,0:34:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I cannot accept that my brother can take Wang Zhong alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.70,0:34:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but I can only throw empty insults!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.94,0:34:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up! Keep insulting them! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.94,0:34:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse them!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.26,0:34:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse them! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Dai, you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.74,0:34:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you curse his ancestors?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.30,0:34:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We did!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.98,0:34:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Dai must be furious!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.18,0:35:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't even stirred!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.02,0:35:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.10,0:35:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.06,0:35:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.06,0:35:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhang, a few strikes is enough. Must you be so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.70,0:36:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my own business as a general! It has nothing to do with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.62,0:36:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass down my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.02,0:36:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That rat Liu Dai doesn't even leave his camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.02,0:36:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He just stays in his camp, doing who knows what!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.10,0:36:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't come, I'll go to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.94,0:36:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,General?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.86,0:36:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Tell every camp to ready the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.46,0:36:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Tonight, at the third watch, we shall lead a surprise attack on their camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.86,0:36:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll break down their gates!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.22,0:36:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you capture the camp if you are drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.98,0:36:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we not postpone?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.18,0:36:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.10,0:36:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a few liters of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.06,0:36:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How can that intoxicate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.26,0:36:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass down my orders. Everyone must prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.94,0:36:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.30,0:36:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.54,0:37:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,... don't forget to tie this soldier real tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.54,0:37:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When we strike the enemy... I'll... I'll offer him as a sacrifice before the banner!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.22,0:37:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.14,0:37:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That Zhang Fei said...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.54,0:37:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that he would offer me as a sacrifice \Nbefore attacking the camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.62,0:38:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So that Zhang Fei is just a reckless idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.02,0:38:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few days without fighting and that's enough to work him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.22,0:38:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the opportunity for us to meet one plan with another.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.18,0:38:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him bring his troops to an empty camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.06,0:38:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lure him into my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.42,0:38:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I reckon that soldier is at Liu Dai's camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.90,0:39:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We will go by three separate ways at the third watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.14,0:39:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll lead the elite troops and cut off his rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.94,0:39:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,On the middle route, thirty men will sneak into their camp and light a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.62,0:39:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The two other groups will launch a surprise attack against Liu Dai when they see the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.86,0:39:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.22,0:39:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I wagered my own head before my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.78,0:39:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If someone kills Liu Dai, I will kill the offender!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.66,0:39:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Officers, do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.74,0:39:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.30,0:39:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good. Don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.86,0:39:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.06,0:39:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass my orders! It's the third watch! We will assault their camp!
Comment: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:24.46,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Tian Feng's strategy.

